    line: "Each hole's intercept as thickness and grade × thickness, in plan or long section.",
    picture: { drop: ["plan"], alt: "Each hole is one point on the plan, drawn by its grade times thickness." },
    cautions: ["Not a resource estimate: a target's size and tenor.", "A hole with no intercept counts as zero, not missing."],
